   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing assessment types",
     "texto": [
      "**Mens** can present two simultaneous situations or contrast them: **En hjemmeeksamen gir tid, mens en muntlig høring tester spontan forståelse** («A take-home exam gives time, whereas an oral test assesses spontaneous understanding»).",
      "Norwegian compound nouns are usually written together: **mappevurdering**, assessment through a folder of work."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clear criteria",
     "texto": [
      "**Vurderingskriterier** are the criteria by which a task is assessed. One format may favour reflection and another may measure spontaneous response."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
